    rewardUnlockId: 
  - title: Paper Trail
    memo: 'MEMO: Accounting couriers are carrying our campaign plans along the window
      row to the door. Shoot down four before three get out. They always fly the
      same line, and one rival flies cover. Ride the radiators to stay above them.'
    mode: 2
    room: 0
    place: 'Office: the window row'
