  - title: The Stapler
    memo: 'MEMO: Accounting''s desk guardian has woken up on YOUR desk. Its jaw is
      armored; hit the glowing mouth when it opens. When the jaw rises, it slams
      and blasts the air down: get clear.'
    mode: 3
    room: 0
    place: 'Office: your desk'
