  - title: Office Party
    memo: 'MEMO: Somebody''s leaving do, and Accounting crashed it. Four kills among
      the balloons (shoot them to clear a lane). Watch the appliances: the microwave
      dumps heat when it dings, the fridge door swings open, and the vending machine
      has gone haywire.'
    mode: 2
    room: 1
    place: 'Break room: the party'
    area: 
