  - title: Coffee Run
    memo: 'MEMO: Two of our couriers (blue) are flying the morning coffee orders
      from the machine to the door. Rivals will hunt them. Stay close and shoot whatever
      gets on their tail. We can lose one, not two.'
    mode: 2
    room: 1
