  - title: Cold Boot
    memo: 'MEMO: Two Marketing wingmen (blue) fly with you tonight against a whole
      squadron. Eight kills between you. The tape robot rides its gantry overhead
      and the halon alarm slams everyone down: listen for the siren.'
    mode: 4
    room: 2
    place: 'Server room: the aisles'
