  - title: Sysadmin
    memo: 'MEMO: IT''s best pilot (gold trail) is hunting you: tougher paper, sharper
      turns, longer bursts. Shoot it down twice. The lights keep cutting out; the
      racks still glow, and so does its trail.'
    mode: 2
    room: 2
    place: 'Server room: lights out'
