  - title: Fire Escape
    memo: 'MEMO: Accounting is running its files up the stairwell to the roof. The
      couriers spiral up the warm chimney: climb with them and shoot down five before
      three reach the top. The doors on every floor gust open: they shove you, and
      them.'
