  - title: The Condenser
    memo: 'FINAL MEMO: The building''s giant AC unit is Accounting''s last weapon.
      Its fan blows you sky-high and throws rings of debris, then reverses and sucks
      you into the grille. Shoot off its coolant tanks, hit the hub when the fan
      stalls. End the Night Shift War.'
